's needs. Verify if awardee A's contracts are for distinct projects or repeated services. Review if multiple contracts for similar work were awarded in the same period.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["wudecB1dxn%2BExvMJXBMHHQ%3D%3D","zKxOLAUfmV6cTfjQf3USOg%3D%3D","d9ZfziMtyCtQFSeKCRun4Q%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}